        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "t594",
          "name": "Notes: counts and dates are ",
          "content": "Notes: counts and dates are illustrative; lock timeout choices and password rules come from the owner's decisions of 2026-09-20. Drawn in English; Indonesian copy is reviewed by the owner. The privacy statement must trace to controls and tests (TC-081).",
